        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJDZWJGwcPW447nNlSYVLQYPxlJsdXGNdap-37bzOTwfpoCZw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "After looking for a decent place to find a good pair of running shoes, my husband found this place online. First of all the service is really amazing and tailored to the customer. They are extremely knowledgeable and spend lots of time making sure to find the best shoe for you. Even better, they have a treadmill to actually test the shoes out, which I think is critical. I’ve returned too many shoes that seemed fine in store and then as soon as I got to a gym found out they didn’t work for whatever reason. They even gave me tips on ways to improve my form, stretches to try etc. And bonus, they were so sweet with my toddler who was very enthusiastic about being there. Super super happy with the service and I’m sure my runs will be more enjoyable. Thank you!!",
        "time": 1736707522,
        "translated": false
      },
