        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLKkZEugBVUd4IZiLOMTAnKvBLADqPt8lGBkO2tE-hoIHDjrw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I had an exceptional experience with Alexandre! He took the time to advise me on finding the perfect pair of running shoes for my needs. His service was personalized, professional, and truly attentive to detail. One gesture I greatly appreciated: he allowed my dog ​​to come into the store with me so he wouldn't have to stay in the car for too long. Such human attention makes all the difference! Thank you again for this impeccable service—I highly recommend him!",
